WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.485
Jobs controls the vacancies on Careers.

00:00:03.535 --> 00:00:09.087
Create a new job, or open an existing one to edit its title, department,

00:00:09.137 --> 00:00:13.056
location, employment type, experience, and summary.

00:00:13.106 --> 00:00:18.347
The posting and closing dates determine when a vacancy is available.
